{
  "title": {
    "en": "Proverbs for Kids"
  },
  "subtitle": {
    "en": "All 31 chapters, every major theme — practical wisdom for everyday life!"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Short, punchy, unforgettable sayings about everyday wisdom. Thirty-nine adventures through all thirty-one chapters: the nine opening discourses on choosing wisdom over folly, twenty themed journeys through the book's great collected sayings — covering wise vs. foolish vs. mocking, speech, work, pride, honesty, friendship, anger, generosity, discipline, money, God's sovereignty, family, justice, leadership, gossip, envy, counsel, self-control, and the brevity of life — and the closing voices of Agur, King Lemuel, and the woman worth more than rubies."
  },
